// ║  [SEC-CATCHALL-1] (2026-08-16) The root catch-all's WRITE grant is        ║
// ║     REMOVED — `match /{document=**}` is now READ-only for super-admin.     ║
// ║     A browser super-admin no longer ORs past ANY collection rule; every    ║
