// ║     closed month. read = super-admin | isFinanceReader (owner|admin);      ║
// ║     create/update/delete = FALSE for every browser role, super-admin       ║
// ║     included. The ONLY writer is `salownCloseFinancePeriod` via the Admin  ║
// ║     SDK. The [G4] catch-all READ excludes the collection the same way it   ║
